: _nu_pnz fi>i v sep ? && < v 9007199254740992. == Fl v v N I v { = r _nu_grade v _nu_pdig r @ + _me_lb 12 sep }
: _nu_ps f>i x ? != x x "NaN" ? == x 0. P '0 { ? < x 0. P '- 0 = a Ab x ? ~ _nu_fin a "Infinity" _nu_pnz a 46 }
